        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Annual Survey of School System Finances (F-33)",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "F-33 provides annual district- and state-level public school finance data. It supplies cost and resource context; it does not establish that an initiative caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "412ff593e9154012a43d4c27ec5c68b6"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/school-finances/about.html",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "23900d3d136b45ab929ef837a114a320"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "F-33 catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** U.S. Census Bureau.\n- **Access:** Downloadable files and Census API; current API queries require a key.\n- **Unit:** Public elementary-secondary school system, fiscal year.\n- **Coverage:** 2012–2024 in the published time-series API; historical files are separate.\n- **Join keys:** School district identifier, state, and fiscal year.\n- **Measures:** Revenue by source, expenditure by function, debt, assets, and enrollment.\n- **Use boundary:** Deflate money values and document fiscal-year alignment before comparing programs.\n\nF-33 can provide cost, resource-intensity, and finance context. Its released values do not alone establish that a program caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
